{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"2004","name":"导能原盘 绪论","desc":"1.5 活动一","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/04/25/76078930/b1110eb5e4e68f78cea94ea2ae4fc45d_4784408893040758827.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"活动说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e活动期间，旅行者可以挑战\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(65, 70, 75)\\\"\u003e「调查点」、「秘境」和「扭曲幽域」，获取「碎果数据」。使用「碎果数据」可以兑换\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e「猫尾特调·迪奥娜(冰)」、原石、智识之冕、角色经验素材、摩拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(65, 70, 75)\\\"\u003e等奖励\u003c/span\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/27/75276539/55d54c2fb7177c93a5213d22767c2b54_788300971255068913.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"745\\\" data-image-originwidth=\\\"745\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 745px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/27/75276539/55d54c2fb7177c93a5213d22767c2b54_788300971255068913.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 745px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动参与条件〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥20级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1317","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"玩法说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e活动期间，旅行者可以通过挑战「调查点」、\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(65, 70, 75)\\\"\u003e「秘境」、「扭曲幽域」，获取\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e「碎果数据」\u003c/span\u003e，换取活动商店中的物资。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/29/75276545/e7c8c32091cd9287cfc8775d54b60ba6_7165290713206582334.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"600\\\" data-image-originwidth=\\\"600\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 600px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/29/75276545/e7c8c32091cd9287cfc8775d54b60ba6_7165290713206582334.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 600px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e● \u003cstrong\u003e探索「调查点」\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e旅行者们的目标是前往各处的「调查点」，回收\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e「地脉之果碎片」\u003c/span\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/a7a5327455d16d9ccabe02c2ca513de0_1228762930997455786.gif?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,gif\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"905\\\" data-image-originwidth=\\\"905\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 905px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/a7a5327455d16d9ccabe02c2ca513de0_1228762930997455786.gif?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,gif\\\" style=\\\"width: 905px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「地脉之果碎片」周围有魔物镇守，只有将所有魔物都击败后，才可以回收「地脉之果碎片」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/c3cb577be3965b2f9393686c7f6faae6_1698749345183636095.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"759\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 759px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/c3cb577be3965b2f9393686c7f6faae6_1698749345183636095.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 759px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「调查点」中还存在着一种\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e「异变之石」\u003c/span\u003e，可以强化碎片周围的魔物，本丘推荐旅行者们在战斗过程中\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e优先破坏「异变之石」\u003c/span\u003e，再与魔物战斗。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/aca025626b1a629dea25a18642163b8b_3396215195730686892.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"633\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 633px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/aca025626b1a629dea25a18642163b8b_3396215195730686892.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 633px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e旅行者们一共可以从「调查点」中回收以下三种「地脉之果碎片」：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/c6819b4f8a04101c1260cdd0553cbb33_5234591559359322326.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1334\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1334px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/c6819b4f8a04101c1260cdd0553cbb33_5234591559359322326.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1334px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e这些碎片有什么用途呢？ 下面为大家介绍一种\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e特殊的装置——「导能原盘」\u003c/span\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e● \u003cstrong\u003e配置「导能原盘」\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「导能原盘」是一种能够激活「地脉之果碎片」的装置。在导能原盘中装备「地脉之果碎片」，可以为队伍中的角色提供相应的增幅效果（\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e仅在「秘境」和「扭曲幽域」中生效）。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「导能原盘」的配置界面如下：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/956d0a80685b938a07220ad11817b7c4_6636104368824575970.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1067\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/956d0a80685b938a07220ad11817b7c4_6636104368824575970.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e小贴士：在多人状态下进入活动秘境，导能原盘将自动切换为主机（队伍中作为1P的旅行者）的多人方案，因此请旅行者们提前配置多人方案中的地脉之果碎片。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e装备「地脉之果碎片」需要消耗相应的「驱动力」。消耗越多的「驱动力」就能激活更多、更高品质的「地脉之果碎片」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/988ced6f033d1ec2b5277d2442e30519_104531447384664571.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1067\\\" data-image-originwidth=\\\"1067\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/988ced6f033d1ec2b5277d2442e30519_104531447384664571.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e旅行者们初始拥有的「驱动力」与自身所有角色等级的总和相关，等级之和越高，驱动力越大。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e当「驱动力」不足时，旅行者们可以\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e向好友借取最多三名角色的力量\u003c/span\u003e，来协助自身原盘获取驱动力（可用驱动力已经达到上限时，将无法获得协助驱动力）。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/b727b2257a09abaee5683fec31e6ae61_4000868254659551824.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1067\\\" data-image-originwidth=\\\"1067\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/b727b2257a09abaee5683fec31e6ae61_4000868254659551824.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e● \u003cstrong\u003e挑战「秘境」\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e活动期间，每一幕开启时，都会开启一个新的\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(65, 70, 75)\\\"\u003e「秘境」。\u003c/span\u003e成功挑战\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(65, 70, 75)\\\"\u003e「秘境」后，\u003c/span\u003e旅行者们可以获得\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e「碎果数据」，并解锁「扭曲幽域」中相应的挑战\u003c/span\u003e。\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(65, 70, 75)\\\"\u003e每个秘境仅可通关1次。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/10c93c9f7aa71a20b15e3a8757ef54ee_7875082725841702307.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1334\\\" data-image-originwidth=\\\"1334\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1334px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/10c93c9f7aa71a20b15e3a8757ef54ee_7875082725841702307.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1334px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e● \u003cstrong\u003e挑战「扭曲幽域」\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e活动期间，旅行者可以挑战\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(65, 70, 75)\\\"\u003e「扭曲幽域」获取\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e挑战积分。开启「扭曲幽域」需要先完成对应的「秘境」挑战。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/05e5039bc277d30d85413719f33fc637_2683521299185909424.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1067\\\" data-image-originwidth=\\\"1067\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/05e5039bc277d30d85413719f33fc637_2683521299185909424.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e正式开始挑战前，旅行者们可以选择不同的挑战难度和挑战条件。挑战完成后，根据所选择的挑战难度和条件，可获得相应的挑战积分。首次通关还可领取原石奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/756d73894e37cef62da2c2987a3a9569_1471197578434198517.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1067\\\" data-image-originwidth=\\\"1067\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/756d73894e37cef62da2c2987a3a9569_1471197578434198517.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e 活动期间内，旅行者们可以多次挑战同一关卡，并刷新该关卡最高记录。\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e累积挑\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(192, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e战积分为当前所有挑战关卡最高记录积分之和\u003c/span\u003e，达到指定累积挑战积分时可领取\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e「碎果数据」\u003c/span\u003e和\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e限定名片\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e「庆典·慧果」\u003c/span\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/133db8d4673e0d1c64be550d4ead3e23_3020837866458742482.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1067\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/28/75276545/133db8d4673e0d1c64be550d4ead3e23_3020837866458742482.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px; border: \\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(190, 26, 29)\\\"\u003e※活动玩法结束后，将无法领取「扭曲幽域」的积分奖励，请旅行者及时领取奖励。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e友情提示：强烈推荐旅行者们与小伙伴们组队进行挑战哦！\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1318","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n